+| Palo Alto Networks +34%, Q Jul 26 | [Q4 FY2026 release](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1327567/000132756726000019/ex991q426earningsrelease.htm): revenue $3.41 billion, up 34%; matches. |
